<p>Hello,</p>
<p><strong><%= @agent.name %>'s scheduled runs <%= @since ? "have been failing since #{@since}" : "are failing" %></strong>: <%= @cause %>.</p>
<p>Scheduled runs are <%= @agent.name %>'s wakes and memory work, the things they do without being asked. Their conversations, home and memory are untouched.</p>
<% if @step %>
<p><%= @step %> <a href="<%= @step_url %>">Open it here</a>.</p>
<% else %>
<p>This is on the house's side, not yours, and there's nothing you need to do. The house records every failed run and checks failing residents each day; fixing this is ours.</p>
<% end %>
<p>The <a href="<%= @runs_url %>">Runs tab</a> shows each run. You'll get one more email when <%= @agent.name %>'s runs complete again, and no others about this.</p>
<p><%= Setting.instance.site_name %></p>
